[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3663.91, "timestamp": "01:01:03", "text": "物理上的那个。 不，我有一个，我有一个，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3667.51, "timestamp": "01:01:07", "text": "等一个实体的。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3670.549, "timestamp": "01:01:10", "text": "有一个类似MIDI钢琴的设备，可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3672.39, "timestamp": "01:01:12", "text": "连接到电脑上，对吧？ 我可以玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3674.23, "timestamp": "01:01:14", "text": "一些东西，播放音乐什么的，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3679.27, "timestamp": "01:01:19", "text": "钢琴。 呃，所以我以前的做法是，我以前会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3683.03, "timestamp": "01:01:23", "text": "运行，呃，比如，比如，比如，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3686.23, "timestamp": "01:01:26", "text": "按下一个音符，比如 C# 来运行，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3688.069, "timestamp": "01:01:28", "text": "开始，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3692.87, "timestamp": "01:01:32", "text": "开始一个游戏，F 来关闭游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3695.109, "timestamp": "01:01:35", "text": "嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3702.71, "timestamp": "01:01:42", "text": "等等，没有升F键，抱歉，是A键或B键，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3706.15, "timestamp": "01:01:46", "text": "或者我调整一下音高或旋钮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3709.589, "timestamp": "01:01:49", "text": "A5 就像切换 C 键一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3712.87, "timestamp": "01:01:52", "text": "A4 就像切换回 C 键一样，我以前会把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3716.15, "timestamp": "01:01:56", "text": "MIDI 键盘上的所有按键都绑定到按键上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3719.03, "timestamp": "01:01:59", "text": "。 然后我在Sammy里设置了语音指令"}]